<title>THAILAND: Saha Patanapibul Plc Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Saha Patanapibul Plc Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter ended March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>		  (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				 1997		1996</p>
